# ONNX Runtime Web assets for offline use.
#
# The loader and the .wasm MUST come from the same release: the loader
# fetches a version-specific artifact name, so a newer ort.*.js beside an
# older .wasm 404s at session-create time and the font classifier silently
# falls back to "Arial" for every block.
#
# Currently vendored: 1.26.0, wasm-only build.
#   ort.wasm.min.js               ← loader (referenced by index.html)
#   ort-wasm-simd-threaded.mjs    ← module the loader dynamically imports
#   ort-wasm-simd-threaded.wasm   ← the runtime itself
#
# Refresh with:
#   V=1.26.0
#   for f in ort.wasm.min.js ort-wasm-simd-threaded.mjs ort-wasm-simd-threaded.wasm; do
#     curl -LO "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/onnxruntime-web@$V/dist/$f"
#   done
#
# Do NOT add the full ort.min.js bundle unless you also vendor the 26 MB
# ort-wasm-simd-threaded.jsep.wasm it requires; main.js only ever requests
# the 'wasm' execution provider.
#
# Verify with: npm run check
